# era-fnb-pos — module map

| Route | API | Role |
|-------|-----|------|
| `/floor` | tickets, tables, outlets, sold-out | Cashier PIN / waiter — empty ticket, bitdi/var |
| `/pin` | `POST /api/auth/pin` | Cashier/waiter/kitchen PIN (not owner password) |
| `/m/[slug]` | `GET /api/public/menu/[slug]` | Public QR read-only (no guest order) |
| `/orders` | tickets, pay, offline replay | Cashier / manager |
| `/kds` | kds fire | `fnb_kitchen_kds` |
| `/admin/access` | `/api/admin/roles`, `…/permissions`, refresh-permissions | `admin:access_manage` + `screen:admin.access` — Variant A matrix |
| `/admin/menu` | menu CRUD, `/api/menu/[id]/prices`, `/api/menu/export`, `/api/menu/suggest` | `api:menu.manage` / `screen:admin.menu` |
| `/admin/tables` | tables | `api:tables.manage` / `screen:admin.tables` |
| `/pin` | `POST /api/auth/pin` `{ organizationId, outletId, pin }` | PIN package grants; fail-closed if outlet unbound |

Hotel-only (403 when edition=kafe): banquets, in-house, room-charge, defer-to-hub, room-service.

Org bind: runtime-config `onSharedOrgSnapshot` → `FnbOrgProfile` (per-org edition/modules in SHARED pool). Quotas: 120 ticket creates/min/org, 600 QR reads/min/IP.

**SaaS:** login JWT `organizationId`; Kafe onboard upserts `SatelliteEndpoint` to pool URL (`ERA_FNB_POS_ORIGIN`). Schema+kit SHARED is in production path; live two-org field UAT remains a Product-Readiness 🟡, not a missing process.
| `/orders` | tickets, in-house link, room-charge, pay cash/card, `defer-to-hub`, shift panel | Waiter / manager |
| `/kds` | kds fire | Kitchen |
| `/admin/menu` | `/api/menu`, `/api/menu/categories`, `/api/menu/[id]`, `/api/menu/[id]/prices` | Manager — categories/items modal CRUD, price history, recipeSku, imageUrl |
| `/admin/import` | `/api/import`, `/api/import/[entity]` | Manager / super-admin — Nafta cutover `#30`–`#32` (groups, cards, walk-in cheques) |
| `/admin/tables` | `/api/tables`, `/api/tables/[id]` | Manager — static table master CRUD |
| `/admin/daily-menu` | `/api/admin/daily-menu` | Manager |
| `/admin/settings` | outlet config | Admin |

Integration: `GET /api/in-house`, `GET /api/banquets`, `GET /api/billing/context`, PMS room-charge + settlement pending bridge (`POST /api/tickets/[id]/defer-to-hub`, `POST /api/integration/settlement-confirmed`). CP staff: `POST /api/integration/staff-provision` (`enterRequestTenant`, scrypt User hash, SHA-256 PIN roster). Standalone GL: `SATELLITE_FB_SALE_COMPLETED` on local pay, `SATELLITE_FB_SHIFT_CLOSED` on Z-close. Org bind: `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/organization/bind` (ADR satellite-organization-bind).

**SaaS Wave 3 request tenant:** staff login/SSO JWT `organizationId`; middleware `x-era-organization-id`; `assertFnbEntitled` → ALS; ops stamps via `requestOrganizationId()`. Not sellable SHARED pool / no TENANT Scaffold ✅.
